(The ledger's buffer leaves, night of 2026-08-28 - docs/ledger/buffers.md
 rows BUF-06, BUF-11, BUF-15, BUF-16, BUF-17, BUF-29, BUF-30, BUF-33.
 Same shape as tests/300_gen_buffers_a.vox and for the same reason: each
 leaf is called directly off a pinned rng seed and its emitted source
 printed in full, so the golden is the generated Vox itself, at the true
 top level (nested false) and inside a block (nested true) both.

 BUF-11 gets three seeds instead of one: the whole point of 'gen leaf
 buffer length synonym' is that the mutation between the two checks is
 drawn, not fixed, so one golden alone would not show that the append,
 set-byte and clear branches are all actually reachable.)

Print "--- BUF-06: append past a fixed buffer's capacity truncates at capacity ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer fixed overflow' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer fixed overflow' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BUF-15, BUF-16, BUF-17: resize, grow-preserves, shrink-truncates ---".
'rng seed' of 2.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer resize' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 2.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer resize' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BUF-29, BUF-30: write bound is capacity, read bound is size ---".
'rng seed' of 3.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer write read bounds' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 3.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer write read bounds' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BUF-33: clear sets size to 0 and preserves capacity - fixed form ---".
'rng seed' of 4.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer clear' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BUF-33 again - dynamic form draws too ---".
'rng seed' of 40.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer clear' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 4.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer clear' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BUF-11: length is size, mutation drawn - append branch ---".
'rng seed' of 5.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer length synonym' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BUF-11 again - set-byte branch ---".
'rng seed' of 7.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer length synonym' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BUF-11 again - clear branch ---".
'rng seed' of 4.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer length synonym' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 5.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf buffer length synonym' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.
